  // ─── Run #128 BUG FIX: speak() race/overlap + div-by-zero sweep ────────
  // (a) Rapid 🔊 clicks (surfaced by R127 per-turn buttons in cvg drill)
  // caused audio overlap — in-flight speakSmart loops continued even after
  // a new speak() started. Fix: _speakGen counter + stopAllAudio() fn +
  // abort check between chunks in speakSmart.
